WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.208 --> 00:00:02.219
(upbeat music)
- I have had one beer.

00:00:02.219 --> 00:00:04.125
(laughing) I'm so buzzed!

00:00:09.288 --> 00:00:11.544
- Time to get drunk!

00:00:12.889 --> 00:00:13.782
- What are you making?

00:00:13.782 --> 00:00:17.582
- 5% vodka, 95% orange juice.

00:00:18.693 --> 00:00:20.052
- One, two, three.

00:00:21.113 --> 00:00:23.242
(gasping and gagging)

00:00:24.477 --> 00:00:25.960
- It's not gonna hurt,
it's not gonna sting,

00:00:25.960 --> 00:00:26.886
it's not gonna taste like

00:00:26.886 --> 00:00:28.694
(crying) burning alcohol, it's just fine!

00:00:28.694 --> 00:00:29.928
- Turn up!

00:00:30.766 --> 00:00:32.184
I'm gonna throw up.

00:00:33.143 --> 00:00:34.972
- I don't wanna die alone!

00:00:34.972 --> 00:00:36.699
Will you drive me home?

00:00:36.699 --> 00:00:37.776
- It's only 8:30.

00:00:37.776 --> 00:00:38.879
(girl whimpers)

00:00:39.137 --> 00:00:39.981
- Buddy.

00:00:39.981 --> 00:00:42.882
- Oh, a beer, I like these beers.

00:00:47.336 --> 00:00:48.997
(liquid trickling)

00:00:49.826 --> 00:00:52.361
- I can't believe I
finished this so quickly!

00:00:56.815 --> 00:00:58.887
- Guys, I have to admit something.

00:00:58.887 --> 00:01:00.027
I suck at drinking.

00:01:00.027 --> 00:01:01.264
- (sigh of relief) Me too!

00:01:01.264 --> 00:01:02.262
- I also suck at that! (laughs)

00:01:02.262 --> 00:01:02.994
- I'm so bad at it!

00:01:02.994 --> 00:01:03.847
- Ah, thank you!

00:01:03.847 --> 00:01:05.086
- You guys, we should just pretend

00:01:05.086 --> 00:01:06.874
to be drunk and dance like idiots.

00:01:06.874 --> 00:01:07.606
- Yes!

00:01:07.606 --> 00:01:08.418
- Uh, yes!

00:01:08.418 --> 00:01:10.014
(music intensifies)

00:01:10.014 --> 00:01:13.658
(singing) Oh, man, I'm
feeling so good tonight!

